      "findings": [
        {
          "id": "D1-RP-001",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "blockingAuthority": "author",
          "title": "CLI-owned D1 mutation paths 缺少可匹配的 OpenSpec delta capability relation",
          "problem": "051 Apply mutation scope 明确包含 src/cli/architecture.ts、src/cli/main.ts 与 tests/unit/cli/architecture.test.ts，同时 Design 决定 src/cli/** 继续由现有 cli-diagnostics Verification module ownership。Base 上 cli-diagnostics.capabilityIds 仅包含 flowkit-change-cli-end-to-end-and-performance、flowkit-diagnostic-cli、flowkit-openspec-1-7-thin-integration、flowkit-policy-engine、flowkit-runtime-foundation；051 当前 OpenSpec delta capability 只有 flowkit-architecture-assets、flowkit-change-verification-selection、flowkit-external-tool-runtime。两者无交集。当前 buildVerificationSelection() 对每个 seed module 强制要求至少命中一个当前 delta capability，所以按 051 当前 Design 只新增 architecture module/check 后，formal Apply Verification 会在 cli-diagnostics seed 上 fail closed。",
          "contractRef": "051 design.md Decisions 7-8 / flowkit-change-verification-selection delta spec；Base src/verification/change-selection/selection.ts buildVerificationSelection() seed capability relation；Flowkit Explore Skill v2 Mutation Surface + Verification Closure",
          "invariant": "Proposal 冻结的 Apply mutation surface 中，每个实际 seed Verification module 必须与当前 OpenSpec delta capability 有合法关系，并能进入 physical selected-check closure；不能只证明 path ownership/selector 唯一而忽略 capability admission。",
          "requiredOutcome": "最小 revise-propose 冻结 CLI-owned D1 paths 与当前 D1 OpenSpec delta capability 的合法 relation，同时保持 src/cli/** ownership 不重叠。实现选择由 Author 决定；例如可让 cli-diagnostics 明确承认 flowkit-architecture-assets capability，并补对应 module-map contract/tests。Proposal 必须增加一个 read-only next-consumer dry selection：使用预期 D1 actualChangeSet + 三个 D1 delta capability refs，buildVerificationSelection() 成功且所有 seed module 均有 applicable capability relation。",
          "acceptance": [
            "src/cli/architecture.ts、src/cli/main.ts、tests/unit/cli/architecture.test.ts 保持唯一 non-overlapping ownership。",
            "包含这些 CLI paths 的预期 D1 actualChangeSet 与 051 三个 delta capability refs 调用 buildVerificationSelection() 不再抛 VERIFICATION_CAPABILITY_SELECTION_FAILED。",
            "selection.capabilityRelation = matched，seedModuleIds 中 cli-diagnostics 有明确 applicable D1 capability。",
            "formal selection 仍能覆盖 tests-cli，并在完整 D1 mutation set 上同时覆盖 tests-architecture 与其他 affected checks。",
            "不通过扩大为新 Registry/第二 Verification system 解决。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
